		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Blue-white human-sized figure with no facial features except a fanged mouth, and an eyeball in the palm of each clawed hand.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 13, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +2 (1d6 + drink bone) or dual gaze, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Drink Bone</strong>. If target had bones softened via gaze, tenome slurps down bone fluid and regains 2d6 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Dual Gaze</strong>. Gaze at one or two mortals within near, CHA 12+ or bones are softened, 1d4 CON damage and fatigued until healed.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
